@ Index:   Problem 11, penny a minute, FV then rate
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ One penny a minute for a year at 1/6%. Solves FV, then I%/a.
LBL ‘P11’
  # Problem 11, first calculate FV then I/a
  60
  24
  365
  ×
  ×
  STO ‘NPPER’
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  1
  6
  ÷
  STO ‘I%/a’
  0
  STO ‘PV’
  -0.01
  STO ‘PMT’
  ENDP
  FV
  I/a
  END
